Package: ubigeocensos
Type: Package
Title: Peruvian Territorial Units in the 1981-2025 Population Censuses
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Alejandro", "Pérez Portocarrero",
           email = "alejandroperezportocarrero@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Datasets of the departments, provinces and districts of Peru,
    identified by their 2025 UBIGEO (INEI) code, with their creation date and
    legal instrument of creation, and their presence in the national population
    censuses of 1981, 1993, 2007, 2017 and 2025. Intended to help harmonise
    census data across years and to account for the creation of new districts.
